XXXIV, 746; XXXVIII, 70; XLI, 427; Eugyppius, LXII,
726, 839, 897; S. Greg. Mag., LXXV, 1048; Alcuinus, CI,
640; S. Remigius Ant., CXXXI, 164; Garnerus, CXCIII,
224; Alanus de Insulis, CCX, 141. — Ratio nos docet recta,
quae agere debemus; Rufinus, XXI, 749; S. Hier XXIV,
