460; V. Hildebertus, CLXXI, 855; Hugo de S. Victore,
CLXXV, 923  <HI REND="ITALIC">et seqq.</HI>  — Homo in ignorantia positus,
Honorius Aug, CLXXII, 243. — Non solum ignari, sed
veritati obstantes, Hugo de S. Vict., CLXXVI, 302. — Ratio
