 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  431. Designantur ex Moyse et Aaron;  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
510. Unum sine altero utile esse non potest;  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  430.</P> <P COM="0084">Novum Testamentum in Veteri Testamento erat S. Ambrosius,
XV, 1250 Testamentum vetus in typo, novum
in veritate;  <HI REND="ITALIC">id.,</HI>  XIV, 331. Umbra in lege, imago in Evangelio,
 <COL N="0085"></COL> veritas in coelestibus;  <HI REND="ITALIC">id.,</HI>  XVI, 94. Abiit dies Testamenti
