B. Pauli,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1299. An titulum Pauli habeat,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  Qua
lingua scripta fuerit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  De ordine Epistolarum
B. Pauli,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1299. Generalis omnium Epistolarum materia,
quaenam sit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1302. Intentio, modus tractandi,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid. et seq.</HI></P> <P COM="0100"><HI REND="ITALIC">De Epistolis 7 canonicis.</HI>  — Epistolae canonicae numero
septem. Sedulius, XIX, 792. Recipiuntur in canone, Epistolae
