significantur: S. Gregor. Mag., LXXIX, 507. — Capilli
subditos significant: Gillebert., CLXXXIV, 118, 121.</P> <P COM="0165">CAPREA, virtutes animarum; Raban. Maur, CXII,
885. — Capreae designant sanctorum dignitatem animarum:
