935. — Compunctio, caliginosa dubietas: Garner. de
S. Victore, CXCIII, 359. — Contritio significatur per vaporem
fumi: Rupert. abb., CLXVII, 1676. — Fumus significat
compunctionem lacrymarum,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1291.</P> <P COM="0202">FUNDAMENTUM, fides: Raban. Maur., CXII, 935.</P> <P COM="0202">FUNICULUS, fides, cogitatio nostra, subtilitas praedicationis,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  937.</P> <P COM="0202"><COL N="0203"></COL> FUNIS, boni eventus, asperitates saeculi,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  936.</P> <P COM="0203">GALBANUS, virtus orationis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  939.</P> <P COM="0203">GALEA dicitur operatio bona,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  940.</P> <P COM="0203">GALILAEA quae interpretatur  <HI REND="ITALIC">rota</HI>  sive  <HI REND="ITALIC">transmigratio</HI> 
facta,  <HI REND="ITALIC">revelatio,</HI>  significat aliquando vitae cursum: Raban.
Maur., CXI, 340. — Galilaea, commutatio vitae, id., CXII,
947.</P> <P COM="0203">GALLINA significat sapientiam, sive sanctam Ecclesiam:
