de S. Victore, CXCIII, 419.</P> <P COM="0203">HIEMS, timor servilis: S. Bernard., CLXXXIII, 1060.</P> <P COM="0203">HINNULI, virtutes spirituales: Raban. Maur., CXII,
954.</P> <P COM="0203">HIRCUS, opera poenitentiae,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></P> <P COM="0203">HIRUNDO, assiduitas orationis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></P> <P COM="0203">HODIE, omne tempus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  964.</P> <P COM="0203">HOLOCAUSTUM, vita contemplativa,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  961.</P> <P COM="0203">HORA, anni: S. Eucher., L, 741.</P> <P COM="0203">HORDEUM, operatio: Raban. Maur., CXII, 1012. — Terrenarum
