S. Bernard., CLXXXIII, 999.</P> <P COM="0203">IACINTUS dicitur coeleste desiderium: Raban Maur.,
CXII, 965.</P> <P COM="0203">IGNIS, charitas, bonum desiderium, ardor sanctitatis,
lumen scientiae, persecutio, doctrina, excellentia temporalis,
zelus, tribulatio,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  966. — Zelus charitatis, compunctio,
ardor passionis: Garner. de S. Victore, CXCIII,
