 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  993.</P> <P COM="0205">MAXILLA, praedicatio,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  997.</P> <P COM="0205">MEDULLA, divitiae terrenae, intentiones,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  — Subtilitas
