Raban. Maur., CXII, 997.</P> <P COM="0205"><COL N="0206"></COL> MENSES, termini actionum, bona quies mentis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></P> <P COM="0206">MERIDIES, plana doctrinarum factorumque claritas:
