CLVIII, 635.</P> <P COM="0214">CLAVIS, inclusio cordis impii: Raban. Maur., CXII,
881.</P> <P COM="0214">CLIBANUS, tormentum carnis et animae,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  894.</P> <P COM="0214">CLYPEUM, superbia,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  895.</P> <P COM="0214">COGNITIO, concubitus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  901.</P> <P COM="0214">COLLES, altitudines,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  900.</P> <P COM="0214">COLLUM, elationis extensio: Garner. de S. Victore,
CXCIII, 190. — Collum extentum significat superbiam:
Rupert. abb., CLXVIII, 944.</P> <P COM="0214">COLOR, conversatio prava: Raban. Maur., CXII, 900.</P> <P COM="0214">COMEDERE, vexare, detrahere,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></P> <P COM="0214">CONSILIUM. Isaias omne spectaculum consilium vocat
