 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  913.</P> <P COM="0215">DRACO, malitia: Garner. de S. Victore, CXCIII, 124.</P> <P COM="0215">DUX, vitia principalia: Raban. Maur., CXII, 913; Garner.
