 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  921.</P> <P COM="0215">FARINA, cogitatio iniqui,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></P> <P COM="0215">FASCICULUS dicuntur peccata,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  920.</P> <P COM="0215">FAVUS, voluptas mundi,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  922.</P> <P COM="0215">FEL, infidelitas,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  923.</P> <P COM="0215">FEMINA, affectus carnalis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></P> <P COM="0215">FEMUR, carnis delectatio,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.:</HI>  Garner. de S. Victore,
