925.</P> <P COM="0215">FEX, peccata,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></P> <P COM="0215">FICUS. Ficus foliis significatur pruritus libidinis: S. Augustin.,
XXXVIII, 442.</P> <P COM="0215">FLAMMA, voluptas, vehementia desiderii mali: Raban.
Maur., CXII, 921. — Aestus carnalium desideriorum: Garn.
