ante ipsum mortuus resurrexit: B. Alcuin., C, 1093.</P> <P COM="0231">RUGITUS Christi sicut leonis: Rupert. abb., CLXIX,
1008.</P> <P COM="0231">SAMARITANUS misericors Christum designat: Vener.
Godefrid. abb., CLXXIV, 269.</P> <P COM="0231">SAPIENTIA. Christus, sapientia Dei ubique praesens:
S. Augustin., XXXV, 1659.</P> <P COM="0231">SARDINUS Redemptoris humanitatem significabat:
B. Alcuin., C, 1116.</P> <P COM="0231">STELLA matutina Christum figurat,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1109. — Secundum
