LXXV, 746; LXXVI, 70, 344, 375, 399, 741, 1102;
LXXVII, 17, 53, 55; LXXIX, 248, 252, 260, 337, 347, 348
 <HI REND="ITALIC">et seqq.,</HI>  361, 405, 406. — S. Isidorus Hispal., LXXXIII,
