S. Victoris, CXCVI, 449. — Christi vita tota in
humilitate fundata est. S. Petrus Cantor, CCV, 62, 63.</P> <P COM="0463"><HI REND="ITALIC">Patientia.</HI>  — Christi patientia quanta. Tertullianus,
