et gloriae, Christus ipse docuit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  431. — Descendit
de coelo ex obedientia,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></P> <P COM="0464"><HI REND="ITALIC">Mansuetudo.</HI>  — Quod severum in aliis in Christo dulce
