ex latere Christi defluentium. Rufinus, XXI 361. — Quo
anno Christus reus ad Pilatum actus sit. Dexter, XXXI,
69. — Qua die crucifixus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  71. — Christus, propinquante
hora passionis, potestate turbatus est. S. Augustinus,
XXXV, 1797, 1799. — Turbatus est quia voluit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
1755. — Turbatus est ne nos desperemus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">id.,</HI>  XXXVIII,
1399. — In Christo turbatur nostra infirmitas,  <HI REND="ITALIC">id.,</HI>  XXXV,
1799. — Humana voluntas in Christo mortem refugiens,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">id.,</HI>  XXXIX, 1513. — Christus sanguinem sudans de toto
corpore quid significet,  <HI REND="ITALIC">id.,</HI>  XXXVII, 1817. — Christi
