 <HI REND="ITALIC">id.,</HI>  XXXVIII, 266, 1108. — Christus apparet Magdalenae,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1148, 1154. — Claritas in Christi corpore cum resurrexit
