858.</P> <P COM="0501">Ratherius, Serm. de Assumpt. B. Mariae, CXXXVI,
749.</P> <P COM="0501">S. Odilo, abb., Sermon. in Purificatione, in Assumptione,
in Nativitate B. Mariae, CXLII, 831-839.</P> <P COM="0501">S. Petrus Damian., Sermon in Annuntiatione, in Assumptione,
in Nativitate B. Mariae, et in Natali Domini,
CXLIV, 555-569.</P> <P COM="0501">Udalricus Cluniac., Sermon. in Assumptione et in
Purificatione B. Mariae, CXLIX, 840, 845.</P> <P COM="0501">Radulfus Ardens, Homiliae in Purificatione, in Annuntiatione,
in Assumptione, in Nativitate B. Mariae, CLV,
727-737.</P> <P COM="0501">S. Anselmus Cantuar., Sermon, in Purificatione, in
