Sermones V, in Octava hujusce festi CLXXIV, 708, 957-989
1006.</P> <P COM="0501"><COL N="0502"></COL> Hugo de S. Victore, Sermon. in Nativitate, in Annuntiatione,
in festivitate; Sermo, IV, in Assumptione; Sermon.
IV, in Purificatione, et in festo B. Mariae, CLXXVII,
907-1060.</P> <P COM="0502">Abaelardus, Sermon in Annuntiatione, in Assumptione,
