et laudibus B. Mariae, CLXXXIV, CLXXV,  <HI REND="ITALIC">passim.</HI></P> <P COM="0502">Ogerius abb., Panegyricus de B. Virgine Maria, Sermon.
in Assumptione B. Mariae, et de Maria, CLXXXIV,
1004-1013.</P> <P COM="0502">Guerricus abb., Serm. in festo Purificationis, in
