 <HI REND="ITALIC">Beda,</HI>  XCV, 151, 152, 154.</ITEM></LIST></DOC> <DOC NAME="Index bibliographicus praedicationis Evangelii" AUTHOR="Editores" TEMPSTAT=MOD COM="0580" SECOND="NO"><COL N="0579"></COL> <HEAD TYPE=main COM="0579">LXXIV.
