Augustod., CLXXII, 866. — Petrus Cantor, CCV, 246. — S.
Martinus Legion., CCIX, 114.</P> <P COM="0599">3 <SUP>o</SUP>  Damnando gulam et ebrietatem. Sic: Tertullianus,
