 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  68. Pauperes pascha divitum,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  75. Pauperculorum
depopulatio omnium maxima,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  Quasi inter
procellas positi,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  101. Paupertas non habet quod
perdere possit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  117. Pauperum cruces ad Deum
