1227; Gratian., CLXXXVII, 1304; Innocent. III, CCXIV,
494, 546; Can. Select., CXCIX, 1078. — 24. In clericos, monachos,
episc. manus violentas mittentes, Eug. II, CV,
546, Nic. I, CXIX, 1114, 1134; Greg. VII, CXLVIII, 359,
Gratian. CLXXXVII, 1068; Petr. Bles., CCVII, 224;
Jun. III, CCXV, 563, 573, 644, 949; CCXVII, 97 — 25.
Non decimantes; res vel bona Ecclesiae spoliantes, Greg.
Tur., LXXI, 352; S. Theod., LXXXVII, 102; Marculf.,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  949; Carolus Magn., XCVII, 833; Lib. Poenit., CV,
765; Rhab. Maur., CXII, 1414; Nic. I, CXIX, 1114; Joannes
VIII, CXXVI, 899, 962; S. Greg. VII, CXLVIII, 471,
528, 537; Pasch II, CLXIII, 628; Coelest. III, CCVI,
1184; Innoc. III, CCXIV, 729; CCXV, 1098. — 26. Violatores
