Magn., XCVII, 897; Isaac. Ling., CXXIV, 1102,
1103; Leo IV, CXV, 674. — 27. Variis de causis excommunicati,
canones de excommunicationis casibus,
XCIX, 1011. Episcopus judicibus electis obedire renuens,
Can. Carth., XCVI, 1054. Qui utuntur sanguine
 <COL N="1358"></COL> pecudum suffocatorum, Adr. XCVIII, 383. Qui odio ad
