excommunicatur,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  — Innocent. III mandat ut
Hildeshemensi episcopo publica excommunicatio denuntietur,
Innocent. III, CCXIV, 870. — Arch. Spalatensi
mandat ut Nicolaum Forensem episcopum publice excommunicet,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  — Mandat Innocent. ut episcopus
Slewicensis excommunicatus denuntietur, id., CCXV, 1316.</P> <P COM="1360">B.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Presbyteros, diaconos, clericos, monachos,</HI>  etc. — Excommunicatur
a presbytero suo diaconus, S. Aug.,
XXXIII, 419. — Item a presbytero suo subdiaconus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  — S.
